===================================================================================================
[Load|Store] Multiple [Increment|Decrement] [After|Before]
===================================================================================================
LDMIA r1, {r2, r3, r4}
  r2 = r1[0]
  r3 = r1[4]
  r4 = r1[8]

   after instruction r1 = r1 + 4 * 3

STMIA  r1, {r2, r3}
   r1[0]  = r2
   r1[4]  = r3



===================================================================================================
[MCR|MRC] CoProcessor Registers  
http://www.heyrick.co.uk/assembler/coprocmnd.html#mrc
===================================================================================================
Transfer from ARM register to coprocessor registers. Direction is leftwards

        mcr  cp0     op1  r         cp1        cp2          op2 
	--------------------------------------------------------
        mcr  p15     0    r0        c8         c3           1  // flush TLB by MVA 


[]  {cp0 cp1}        Selects Class 
[]  {cp2 op1 op2}    Selects Method

    {cp15-c8}  --> TLBFlush Class

    {0, 1, c3} --> Flush_by_MVA method  

    Individual methods have original names this ones called TLBIMVAAIS 
    {http://infocenter.arm.com/help/index.jsp?topic=/com.arm.doc.ddi0388f/CIHDGCDB.html}

    

